From c9a1976c5d72fcfa572394d5f542d2d90630ec4b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 08:51:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add About hero background video, compressed and dimmed
 for legibility

Wire the supplied CPU/circuit animation into the About page hero as
the actual background video (assets/videos/about-hero.mp4), compressed
with ffmpeg from 25.7MB/2560x1440 down to ~5MB/1920x1080 H.264, muted,
no audio track. Use a frame extracted from the compressed video itself
as the poster image so there's no visual jump before playback starts.

The source footage gets genuinely bright and busy at points (dense
white/blue/pink circuit traces), so add filter: brightness(0.4) to the
video element on top of the existing dark gradient scrim -- this caps
worst-case brightness regardless of which frame is showing, keeping
the hero text readable throughout the loop rather than only against
whichever frame happened to get eyeballed.

Also teach the local preview server (scripts/serve.cjs) to serve
.mp4/.webm, since it previously 404'd them.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SjcntVjf5Nr2bdomgFdfPu
---
 about.html                          |   4 ++--
 assets/images/about-hero-poster.jpg | Bin 0 -> 69938 bytes
 assets/videos/README.md             |  26 +++++++++++++++++---------
 assets/videos/about-hero.mp4        | Bin 0 -> 5181938 bytes
 scripts/serve.cjs                   |   2 ++
 styles.css                          |   9 ++++++++-
 6 files changed, 29 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 assets/images/about-hero-poster.jpg
 create mode 100644 assets/videos/about-hero.mp4

diff --git a/about.html b/about.html
index 8b60007..40f1ed2 100644
--- a/about.html
+++ b/about.html
@@ -116,10 +116,10 @@
       </div>
     </header>
     <main id="main" tabindex="-1">
-      <section class="page-hero page-hero-video">
+      <section class="page-hero page-hero-video page-hero-video--about">
         <video
           class="hero-video-media"
-          poster="assets/images/home-background.jpg"
+          poster="assets/images/about-hero-poster.jpg"
           autoplay
           muted
           loop
diff --git a/assets/images/about-hero-poster.jpg b/assets/images/about-hero-poster.jpg
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..d77aeaa07f977d28ad617719afdabfaf5eef4068
